OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman dies in
OL,4,Atwo-car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a woman
OL,7,Fdied following a two-car crash in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FPolice said it was called to reports of
OL,11,Fa crash between a grey Hyundai i30 and
OL,12,Fa silver Vauxhall Agila in Ashby Road,
OL,13,FHinckley, shortly before 22:30 BST on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FA woman in her 60s, who was driving the
OL,17,FVauxhall, was pronounced dead a short
OL,18,Ftime later.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
